<title>MALI: Condom sales boom in Mali.</title>
<headline>Condom sales boom in Mali.</headline>
<dateline>BAMAKO 1996-11-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Condom sales in the West African state of Mali are booming, according to the national committee against the spread of the killer disease AIDS.</p>
<p>The committee said a total of 2,265,926 condoms had been sold from January 1 to September 30.</p>
<p>Sales in 1995 totalled 1,699,014 condoms. Sales have grown annually since the committee launched the campaign in 1992. That year sales totalled 460,332.</p>
